Third-party components and derivation
-------------------------------------

Typora's GitHub theme

  cursor-style/base.css is built on github.css, the "GitHub" theme that ships
  with Typora. The document structure, block geometry and editing-related
  rules of that theme are kept; the colours, type hierarchy, spacing and
  display rules are rewritten. github.css itself is not part of this package.
  It is distributed with Typora without a separate licence text, and its
  copyright stays with Typora and the authors of that theme. The MIT licence
  above covers only the original work by folay-git; it does not extend to
  the parts derived from github.css.

Fonts

  The font files in cursor-style/fonts/ are not covered by the licence above.
  They are Latin-only subsets distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1;
  each font's copyright notice and the full licence text are in the OFL-*.txt
  file next to it:

    Inter           The Inter Project Authors
    JetBrains Mono  The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
    EB Garamond     The EB Garamond Project Authors

Cursor

  The visual design is inspired by Cursor's website. No code, fonts or images
  from Cursor or Anysphere are included, and this project is not affiliated
  with or endorsed by them. "Cursor" in the name only identifies the style
  that inspired the theme; it is a trademark of its owner.
